{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e16-scene-16",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "热搜第一与请假照顾  (Record Ratings and Taking Leave to Care for Him)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Kaiwen celebrates as Twelve Singers tops the trending charts and inspires residents to shelter stranded commuters. At the hospital afterward, Bu Xiaogu returns Chun Yuqiao's book and tells him she took annual leave to care for him. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "十二歌王是热搜榜的第一名，很多网友都自发转帖！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "上海的民众看了报道之后，自发地开放自己的私家住处，给受困者避雨。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们做到了！咱们做到了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这本书原来在你这儿，我以为那天太乱丢了呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没丢，在我这儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟你说啊，这次创造了惊人的收视，而且帮助了许许多多的人，外面是一片叫好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "给你全面检查过了吗？他怎么说？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我请了年假，这几天我就照顾你了，你要是不嫌我烦的话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不是一直都在照顾我吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我去给你倒杯水。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "十二歌王是热搜榜的第一名，很多网友都自发转帖！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Twelve Singers is number one on the trending chart, and countless netizens are sharing posts on their own!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "上海的民众看了报道之后，自发地开放自己的私家住处，给受困者避雨。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After watching the broadcast, local residents voluntarily opened their own homes so stranded people could shelter from the rain.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们做到了！咱们做到了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We pulled it off! We really pulled it off!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这本书原来在你这儿，我以为那天太乱丢了呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So this book was with you all along—I thought it had gotten lost in the chaos that day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没丢，在我这儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It was not lost—I kept it safe right here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟你说啊，这次创造了惊人的收视，而且帮助了许许多多的人，外面是一片叫好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me tell you, this broadcast achieved astonishing ratings, helped so many people, and won universal praise everywhere!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "给你全面检查过了吗？他怎么说？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did the doctor give you a full check-up? What did he say?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nothing serious.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我请了年假，这几天我就照顾你了，你要是不嫌我烦的话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I took annual leave so I can look after you these next few days, assuming you do not find me annoying.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不是一直都在照顾我吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you not been taking care of me this whole time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我去给你倒杯水。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me go pour you a cup of water.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "十二歌王是热搜榜的第一名，很多网友都自发转帖！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "上海的民众看了报道之后，自发地开放自己的私家住处，给受困者避雨。",
      "gap": 0.5
